					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>600000</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Eulogia Pascalpho&lt;/color&gt;, a knight of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Fallen Empire&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. Her guards were killed in an ambush. She escaped, but is now being followed by (*Threat)a manhunting hare(/Threat).

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Pascalpho&lt;/color&gt; wants you to keep her safe at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Stonkley&lt;/color&gt; for a few hours until her shuttle can come pick her up.

She will bestow 8 honor on whoever accepts this quest. This is enough honor to receive the royal title of Novice, and all benefits that come with it - including the first level of psychic powers.</description>
