							<inSignal>Quest13.pickupShipThing.SentWithExtraColonists</inSignal>
							<introText>You've escaped on the Imperial shuttle!</introText>
							<endingText>The high stellarch will now welcome you into the Imperial flotilla as an honored noble party.

You might stay in the Imperial court and jockey for political power. Perhaps you'll avoid the drama and focus on enjoying ultratech luxuries. Or, you might even buy a ship and set a course for your long-lost home.

The choice is up to you.</endingText>
