						<leaderTitleFemale>Anima Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The spirits of thought and consciousness live within animals and humans alike. The spirits of trees are powerful, as they bridge the power of the air above with that of the ground beneath. It is prophesied that the spirit of the great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Pendant of Trees&lt;/color&gt; will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</description>
